      "catalog_visibility": "visible",
      "description": "<h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">What Makes Our Khoya Kulfi Different?</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Forget everything you know about modern, airy ice cream. Our Authentic Khoya Kulfi is a journey back in time to the grand kitchens of the Mughal emperors. Unlike ice cream, which is whipped to incorporate air, Kulfi is slow-cooked and slow-churned. This traditional process of reducing pure milk down to rich khoya creates a dessert that is dense, creamy, and packed with an intense, milky flavour.</span></p>\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Our Kulfi doesn't melt quickly; it slowly softens, allowing you to savour every rich, decadent bite. The texture is uniquely satisfying—not icy, but creamy and substantial. We flavour our Khoya Kulfi simply and elegantly with a touch of green cardamom and the luxurious aroma of genuine saffron, allowing the pure, caramelized flavour of the khoya to be the true star.</span></p>\n<h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">The Royal Sweets &amp; Restaurant Promise: Authenticity in Every Bite</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">As Stockholm's premier destination for authentic Indo-Pakistani sweets, our Khoya Kulfi is a source of immense pride and a testament to our commitment to tradition.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">The Soul of Our Kulfi - Pure Khoya:</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"> We don't use shortcuts like condensed milk powder. The foundation of our Kulfi is pure, rich khoya, made in-house by slow-cooking high-quality milk for hours. This is the secret to its authentic taste and dense texture.</span></li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">A Celebration of Tradition:</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"> This is not just a dessert; it's a piece of our culinary heritage. We prepare it using the time-honoured methods that have been passed down for generations, ensuring a taste that is both authentic and nostalgic.</span></li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">The Perfect Flavour Balance:</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"> We sweeten our Kulfi just enough to enhance, not overpower, the natural richness of the milk. It is a sophisticated dessert for a discerning palate.</span></li>\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Handcrafted in Stockholm:</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"> Each batch of our Kulfi is churned and frozen right here in our kitchen, guaranteeing a freshness and quality you can taste.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Ingredients:</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Pure Milk Solids (Khoya), Whole Milk, Sugar, Green Cardamom, Saffron.</span></p>\n",
      "short_description": "<h2>Khoya Kulfi</h2>\n<p>The original royal dessert of the subcontinent. Our Khoya Kulfi is a rich, dense, and incredibly creamy traditional ice cream, slow-churned from pure, house-made khoya and delicately perfumed with cardamom and saffron.</p>\n",
